# Multi-group OBJ test fixture for the loadMesh.ts / loadMeshServer.ts fix.
# Two separate cubes, each in its own `g` group, 3 units apart on the X axis.
# Before the fix: only "CubeA" (the first group) would appear in the viewer.
# After the fix: both cubes should render side by side.

g CubeA
v -0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5  0.5 -0.5
v -0.5  0.5 -0.5
v -0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5  0.5  0.5
v -0.5  0.5  0.5
f 1 2 3 4
f 5 6 7 8
f 1 2 6 5
f 4 3 7 8
f 1 4 8 5
f 2 3 7 6

g CubeB
v 2.5 -0.5 -0.5
v 3.5 -0.5 -0.5
v 3.5  0.5 -0.5
v 2.5  0.5 -0.5
v 2.5 -0.5  0.5
v 3.5 -0.5  0.5
v 3.5  0.5  0.5
v 2.5  0.5  0.5
f 9  10 11 12
f 13 14 15 16
f 9  10 14 13
f 12 11 15 16
f 9  12 16 13
f 10 11 15 14
